    "text": "Suppose <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> grams of water evaporate. Then, heat required <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>Mass that converts into ice <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/>Heat released in the process, <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/>Now, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>150</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>",
